FIXTURE-MAP-MT36 — provenance of the fixture pinned by the TX-AGG rows
======================================================================
Written 2026-11-10 by unit U-SPCC-10. The rows files named below are NOT edited
by this note; they stay as the historical record.

CLASSIFICATION: UNVERIFIABLE (not recoverable, not a commit-recorded deletion).
No file anywhere in the workspace, and no blob in any git ref, has the content
that these rows pin. The fixture they name still exists at the recorded path,
but its bytes were rewritten in place after the last run that used it, and the
pre-rewrite bytes were never committed.

